<h2>Inner willow bark</h2>
<li><p class='igt' id='i84'><span class='words' id='i84w'><span class="word" id="i84w0">(Gaɬ)tim</span><span class="word" id="i84w1">ɬegg</span><span class="word" id="i84w2">gitolixdi</span><span class="word" id="i84w3">xits'i</span><span class="word" id="i84w4">iɬt'et</span><span class="word" id="i84w5">tr'anqaye</span><span class="word" id="i84w6">yigixiniɬtl'etl.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i84g'><span class="gloss" id="i84g0">inner willow bark</span><span class="gloss" id="i84g1">fish</span><span class="gloss" id="i84g2">will run</span><span class="gloss" id="i84g3">towards</span><span class="gloss" id="i84g4">continually</span><span class="gloss" id="i84g5">old women</span><span class="gloss" id="i84g6">they braid it</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i84ft'>'The old women are always braiding inner willow bark when it's time for the fish to run.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i85'><span class='words' id='i85w'><span class="word" id="i85w0">Cause</span><span class="word" id="i85w1">iy</span><span class="word" id="i85w2">axa</span><span class="word" id="i85w3">dit'anh</span><span class="word" id="i85w4">iy</span><span class="word" id="i85w5">axa</span><span class="word" id="i85w6">ni'iniyh</span><span class="word" id="i85w7">ts'i.</em></span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i85g'><span class="gloss" id="i85g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i85g1">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i85g2">with</span><span class="gloss" id="i85g3">people do</span><span class="gloss" id="i85g4">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i85g5">with</span><span class="gloss" id="i85g6">people work with</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i85ft'>'Because people work with it, do things with it.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i86'><span class='words' id='i86w'><span class="word" id="i86w0">Xiyaxa</span><span class="word" id="i86w1">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i86w2">dughonxiɬch'iɬ</span><span class="word" id="i86w3">ts'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i86g'><span class="gloss" id="i86g0">they with it</span><span class="gloss" id="i86g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i86g2">they tie them together</span><span class="gloss" id="i86g3"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i86ft'>'They tie things together with it.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i87'><span class='words' id='i87w'><span class="word" id="i87w0">Xilonghts'i</span><span class="word" id="i87w1">vaxa</span><span class="word" id="i87w2">dixit'anh</span><span class="word" id="i87w3">go,</span><span class="word" id="i87w4">tr'itl</span><span class="word" id="i87w5">gigaɬtim.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i87g'><span class="gloss" id="i87g0">many times</span><span class="gloss" id="i87g1">with it</span><span class="gloss" id="i87g2">they do</span><span class="gloss" id="i87g3">this</span><span class="gloss" id="i87g4">willow</span><span class="gloss" id="i87g5">inner willow bark</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i87ft'>'They do lots of things with this inner willow bark.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i88'><span class='words' id='i88w'><span class="word" id="i88w0">Agide.</span><span class="word" id="i88w1">Idits'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i88g'><span class="gloss" id="i88g0">that's all</span><span class="gloss" id="i88g1">forever</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i88ft'>'That's it. No more.'</span></p></li>
<h2>Wild celery</h2>
<li><p class='igt' id='i89'><span class='words' id='i89w'><span class="word" id="i89w0">Dichiyedim</span><span class="word" id="i89w1">iy</span><span class="word" id="i89w2">vits'ixilu'o</span><span class="word" id="i89w3">hiy</span><span class="word" id="i89w4">n'iy</span><span class="word" id="i89w5">deg</span><span class="word" id="i89w6">engithidong</span><span class="word" id="i89w7">xits'i</span><span class="word" id="i89w8">vits'ixilu'o,</span><span class="word" id="i89w9">dichiyedim.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i89g'><span class="gloss" id="i89g0">wild celery</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g1">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g2">it's honored</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g3">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g4"></span><span class="gloss" id="i89g5">around here</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g6">in the past</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g7">from</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g8">it's honored</span><span class="gloss" id="i89g9">wild celery</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i89ft'>'Wild celery has been an honored plant around here since long ago.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i90'><span class='words' id='i90w'><span class="word" id="i90w0"><em>because</em></span><span class="word" id="i90w1">digathtonh</span><span class="word" id="i90w2">tux</span><span class="word" id="i90w3">xiyaxa dit'anh</span><span class="word" id="i90w4">.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i90g'><span class="gloss" id="i90g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i90g1">lucky dance is held</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g2">when</span><span class="gloss" id="i90g3">they use it</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i90ft'>'Because when they had a lucky dance they used it.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i91'><span class='words' id='i91w'><span class="word" id="i91w0">Dichiyedim</span><span class="word" id="i91w1">yan'</span><span class="word" id="i91w2">q'ixidala</span><span class="word" id="i91w3">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i91w4">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i91w5">axa</span><span class="word" id="i91w6">xiytitl-'o</span><span class="word" id="i91w7">go</span><span class="word" id="i91w8">dichiyedim.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i91g'><span class="gloss" id="i91g0">wild celery</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g1">only</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g2">they carry around</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g3">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g4">all</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g5">with</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g6">they praised it</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g7">this</span><span class="gloss" id="i91g8">wild celery</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i91ft'>'Only wild celery was carried and praised.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i92'><span class='words' id='i92w'><span class="word" id="i92w0">Agide.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses'  fid='i92g'><span class="gloss" id="i92g0">that's all</span><span class="gloss" id="i92g1"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i92ft'>'That's it.</span></p></li>
</ol></div><div id='notes'><h2>Notes</h2><ol><li><span class="footnote" id="n1">a.k.a. ginathdloy</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n2">cooked berries; cook hard for 30 mins. with 1 T. sugar; 2-3x as much water as berries; bit of cornstarch to consistency of thin gravy)</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n3">make pudding out of it?</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n4">ED adds dried apples to it; makes pudding with cornstarch</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n5">it penetrates our skin</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n6">Shelters were also lined with the sticky inner side, which would trap mosquitos.---ED</span></li></ol>
</div>
